<title>UK: Peabody Donation Fund adds 50 mln stg to bond.</title>
<headline>Peabody Donation Fund adds 50 mln stg to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PEABODY DONATION FUND</p>
<p> AMT   *50 MLN STG    COUPON     10.25     MATURITY    17.AUG.23</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  130.326   PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY'S    AAA	 S&amp;P	  AAA</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH 50 MLN STG BOND LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY</p>
<p>		IN APRIL 1995</p>
<p>		GUARANTEED BY CERTIFICATE GUARANTEED INSURANCE POLICY</p>
<p>		ISSUED BY AMBAC UK.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
